{"id":"sluchajnost_","lemma":"случайность","pos":"noun","rank":2365,"glosses":["chance","fortuity, fortuitousness"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/6a/Ru-%D1%81%D0%BB%D1%83%D1%87%D0%B0%D0%B9%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D0%BB%D1%83%D1%87%D0%B0%D0%B9%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"случайности","plural":"случайности"},"examples":[{"text":"Это не случайность.","en":"This isn't a fluke.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"not"},null]},{"text":"Мне интересно, действительно ли это была случайность.","en":"I wonder if it really was a coincidence.","words":[{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"it is interesting"},{"g":"really"},{"g":"whether (question)"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null]},{"text":"Я встретила его по чистой случайности.","en":"I met him by pure chance.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to meet","l":"встретить"},{"g":"him / his"},{"g":"along / by"},null,null]},{"text":"Это была просто счастливая случайность.","en":"It was just a happy accident.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"simply, plainly, just"},{"g":"happy","l":"счастливый"},null]},{"text":"По счастливой случайности, никто не утонул.","en":"Luckily nobody drowned.","words":[{"g":"along / by"},null,null,{"g":"nobody, no one"},{"g":"not"},null]}]}